# `start` on `configure` launches the game.
#
# **The game screen is the first one whose contents are not all items.** `goldberg view` and
# `status area` are components; `next turn` and `menu` are action buttons. **This states the view as
# one row naming it and the status as one row carrying its text**, which is `P-608`'s *a status bar,
# always present, that I can check the text of*.

{test name:start-launches-a-new-game-at-the-chosen-size}

{given}
{screen name:configure}
{size name:large chosen:1} -> 1
{item of:configure name:start active:1} -> 1

{when}
{start}

{then}
{screen name:game}
{view of:game name:goldberg size:large} -> 1
{status text:turn 1} -> 1
{item of:game name:next-turn active:1} -> 1
{item of:game name:menu active:1} -> 1
{attention of:next-turn}
